<title>USA: Banta to repurchase up to 1.5 million shrs.</title>
<headline>Banta to repurchase up to 1.5 million shrs.</headline>
<dateline>MENASHA, Wis. 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banta Corp said Tuesday its board of directors has authorized the repurchase of up to 1.5 million shares of common stock.</p>
<p>The technology company also said it has completed a previous repurchase plan of 1.5 million shares.</p>
<p>As of April 18, the printing and digital imaging company had 29.9 million shares outstanding, Banta said.</p>
<p>Banta shares were down 1/8 at 25-5/8 Tuesday.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
